# The line under each title: what the file shows.
note_hello = A square that scales and rotates, written by hand for this demo.
note_hamburger = A menu icon turning into a back arrow, the transition an app bar plays.
note_logo1 = The logo Lottie launched with: 48 layers of shapes drawing the word.
note_logo1_masked = The same logo behind a mask, so the letters are revealed rather than drawn.
note_logo2 = The second cut of the logo, and the heaviest file here at 74 layers.
note_nine_squares = Nine squares trading places on a loop, by Al Boardman.
note_motion_corpse = A 1920 × 1080 composition by Jr.canest, scaled into the space the view has.
note_pin_jump = A map pin landing, with the squash and stretch that gives it weight.
note_twitter_heart = A heart filling and bursting, at 60 frames a second.
note_boat_loader = The longest file here: 888 frames of a boat on water, from four precompositions.
note_icon_transitions = Icons morphing into one another, the shape a tab bar animates.
note_switch = A toggle at control size, 100 × 100 points.

